OL,3,GNEWSAWindow cleaners stuck on 15th
OL,4,Afloor cradle rescued
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have rescued two window
OL,7,Fcleaners who became stranded after
OL,8,Ftheir suspended cradle malfunctioned on
OL,9,Fthe 15th storey of a London skyscraper.
OL,11,FThe men were working on One Blackfriars
OL,12,Fin Blackfriars Road, Southwark on
OL,13,FThursday evening, London Fire Brigade
OL,14,F(LFB) said.
OL,16,FThe service was called shortly before
OL,17,F17:30 BST and used 209 ft (64m)
OL,18,Fturntable ladder to bring the pair down
OL,19,Fto safety, within 45 minutes.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
