OL,3,GNEWSAWindow cleaners stuck on 15th
OL,4,Afloor cradle rescued
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe LFB said no-one was hurt, adding:
OL,7,F"This is a great example of how the
OL,8,Fbrigade uses its specialist equipment
OL,9,Fto meet the challenges of London's
OL,10,Fbuilt environment."
